# Shell scripts run inside Linux containers. A CRLF checkout on Windows makes
# bash read `set -o pipefail\r` as an invalid option and `fi\r` as a syntax
# error - the script then fails silently every loop. This has bitten the IoTDB
# TTL init and the Flink job supervisor; force LF so it cannot recur.
*.sh text eol=lf
# Same reasoning for anything else executed inside a container.
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
